{"id":"dfea0d23e394e93b","group":"16","path":"16/16-df-full-comprehension.md","title":"满理解结构","display":"df-full-comprehension — 满理解结构","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Jacobs — Categorical Logic and Type Theory","book_abbrev":"16","label":"16-df-full-comprehension","display":"df-full-comprehension — 满理解结构","depends_on":["[[16-df-comprehension-category]]"],"source":"Definition 10.4.2, p. 613 (PDF 633)","revision_date":"2026-10-16","aliases":["16-df-full-comprehension"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Jacobs — Categorical Logic and Type Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"16"},{"key":"label","html":"16-df-full-comprehension"},{"key":"display","html":"df-full-comprehension — 满理解结构"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"0ba8f021ca287877\" href=\"?note=0ba8f021ca287877\" title=\"16-df-comprehension-category\">16-df-comprehension-category</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source","html":"Definition 10.4.2, p. 613 (PDF 633)"},{"key":"revision_date","html":"2026-10-16"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>16-df-full-comprehension</span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{CompCat}(p,\\chi)\">\\(\\mathrm{CompCat}(p,\\chi)\\)</span>，见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"0ba8f021ca287877\" href=\"?note=0ba8f021ca287877\" title=\"16-df-comprehension-category\">16-df-comprehension-category</a>。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>对 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X,Y\\in\\mathcal E\">\\(X,Y\\in\\mathcal E\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\chi_{X,Y}\">\\(\\chi_{X,Y}\\)</span> 是下式构造的Hom映射；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\chi(f)=(\\{f\\},pf)\">\\(\\chi(f)=(\\{f\\},pf)\\)</span> 使用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"0ba8f021ca287877\" href=\"?note=0ba8f021ca287877\" title=\"16-df-comprehension-category\">16-df-comprehension-category</a> 的理解函子箭头分量。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{FullComp}\">\\(\\mathrm{FullComp}\\)</span> 为本原子定义的记号，其结构参数与完整条件在下文给出。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\chi_{X,Y}\\coloneqq\\{\\langle f,\\chi(f)\\rangle\\mid f\\in\\mathcal E(X,Y)\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\chi_{X,Y}\\coloneqq\\{\\langle f,\\chi(f)\\rangle\\mid f\\in\\mathcal E(X,Y)\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}full\\text{-}comprehension}\\vdash\\quad \\mathrm{FullComp}(p,\\chi)\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{CompCat}(p,\\chi)\\land(\\forall X,Y\\in\\mathcal E)\\\n\\chi_{X,Y}:\\mathcal E(X,Y)\\xrightarrow{\\sim}\\mathcal B^{\\to}(\\chi X,\\chi Y).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}full\\text{-}comprehension}\\vdash\\quad \\mathrm{FullComp}(p,\\chi)\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{CompCat}(p,\\chi)\\land(\\forall X,Y\\in\\mathcal E)\\\n\\chi_{X,Y}:\\mathcal E(X,Y)\\xrightarrow{\\sim}\\mathcal B^{\\to}(\\chi X,\\chi Y).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>本书的 full comprehension 同时要求 full 和 faithful。</li>\n<li>固定基对象 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"I\">\\(I\\)</span> 后，这给出 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal E_I(X,Y)\\cong(\\mathcal B/I)(\\pi_X,\\pi_Y)\">\\(\\mathcal E_I(X,Y)\\cong(\\mathcal B/I)(\\pi_X,\\pi_Y)\\)</span>，因此可从理解方块恢复垂直箭头。</li>\n<li>来源：Jacobs, <em>Categorical Logic and Type Theory</em>，Definition 10.4.2, p. 613 (PDF 633)。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"16-df-comprehension-category","status":"resolved","id":"0ba8f021ca287877","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[16-df-comprehension-category]]","embed":false},{"target":"16-df-comprehension-category","status":"resolved","id":"0ba8f021ca287877","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{CompCat}(p,\\chi)$，见 [[16-df-comprehension-category]]。","embed":false},{"target":"16-df-comprehension-category","status":"resolved","id":"0ba8f021ca287877","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"对 $X,Y\\in\\mathcal E$，$\\chi_{X,Y}$ 是下式构造的Hom映射；$\\chi(f)=(\\{f\\},pf)$ 使用 [[16-df-comprehension-category]] 的理解函子箭头分量。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathrm{CompCat}(p,\\chi)","display":false},{"tex":"X,Y\\in\\mathcal E","display":false},{"tex":"\\chi_{X,Y}","display":false},{"tex":"\\chi(f)=(\\{f\\},pf)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{FullComp}","display":false},{"tex":"\\chi_{X,Y}\\coloneqq\\{\\langle f,\\chi(f)\\rangle\\mid f\\in\\mathcal E(X,Y)\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}full\\text{-}comprehension}\\vdash\\quad \\mathrm{FullComp}(p,\\chi)\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{CompCat}(p,\\chi)\\land(\\forall X,Y\\in\\mathcal E)\\\n\\chi_{X,Y}:\\mathcal E(X,Y)\\xrightarrow{\\sim}\\mathcal B^{\\to}(\\chi X,\\chi Y).","display":true},{"tex":"I","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal E_I(X,Y)\\cong(\\mathcal B/I)(\\pi_X,\\pi_Y)","display":false}],"bytes":1378,"backlinks":[{"id":"3015a5a145e2e498","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":3,"excerpt":"满理解、单位、依赖积、强依赖和分别采用 [[16-df-full-comprehension]]、[[16-df-comprehension-with-unit]]、[[16-df-comprehension-quantification]]、[[16-df-strong-dependent-coproduct]]。"},{"id":"2ac3d596368e32ad","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{FullComp}$ 的定义及结构参数见 [[16-df-full-comprehension]]。"},{"id":"92bb081cf777d22b","anchor":"ref-7","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{CompUnit}(p,\\chi)$ 采用 [[16-df-comprehension-with-unit]]，$\\mathrm{FullComp}(p,\\chi)$ 采用 [[16-df-full-comprehension]]。$\\mathrm{Mono}$ 采用 [[16-df-pullback-square]]；$\\mathsf{SubsetComp}$ 与 $\\mathsf{FullSubtypes}$ 如下定义。"},{"id":"1bdcb9b14f83cac1","anchor":"ref-30","locations":["正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"[[16-df-comprehension-category]]、[[16-df-full-comprehension]]、[[16-df-comprehension-with-unit]]、[[16-df-closed-comprehension]]、[[16-df-comprehension-quantification]]、[[16-df-comprehension-equality]]、[[16-df-strong-equality]]、[[16-df-dep-pred-semantics]]、[[16-df-dep-pred-semantics-compat]]。DPL 两条纤维化共用语境基底；闭类型、泛对象、相对量词和相等均显式携带。"},{"id":"75a4c54baaa666ef","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"775a56acaa867972","anchor":"ref-10","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"$\\chi$ 对 Hom 的作用 $\\chi_{X,Y}$ 取全部交换方块；箭头范畴与此作用采用 [[16-df-full-comprehension]]。"}],"outgoing":["0ba8f021ca287877"]}